OL,3,AMeghan could return to acting once back
OL,4,Ain UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo details of any role or project have
OL,7,Fbeen confirmed. The Sussexes are
OL,8,Fexpected to arrive back in Britain
OL,9,Fbefore the end of August, with their
OL,10,Fchildren enrolled to start school in
OL,11,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
