OL,3,AFrench becoming more effective in
OL,4,Astopping small boat crossings, UK says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Conservatives described the
OL,7,Fannouncement as a "joke" and said
OL,8,FChannel crossing preventions were "down
OL,9,Fby half over the past year".
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
