OL,3,AFive missing after fire in Swiss Alpine
OL,4,Atown
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive people are missing and eight
OL,7,Fothers injured after a restaurant with
OL,8,Fapartments was "completely destroyed"
OL,9,Fby fire in the Swiss town of Thusis,
OL,10,Fpolice have said.
OL,12,FInitial investigations indicate the
OL,13,Fblaze broke out on the second floor and
OL,14,Fthe cause was still being investigated,
OL,15,Faccording to the Graubunden cantonal
OL,16,Fpolice.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
