OL,3,AFive missing after fire in Swiss Alpine
OL,4,Atown
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said it was called just after
OL,7,Fmidnight local time (22:00 GMT on
OL,8,FThursday) and that nearly 100
OL,9,Ffirefighters responded. The roof had to
OL,10,Fbe opened using a crane after the
OL,11,Fstairwell collapsed.
OL,13,FThe Alpine Graubunden region, also
OL,14,Fknown as Grisons, is a popular holiday
OL,15,Fdestination for both winter sports and
OL,16,Fsummer nature activities in eastern
OL,17,FSwitzerland.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
